    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "text": "The challenge in this petition is made to summoning order dated 14.09.2021, passed in Complaint Case No. 4033 of 2021, Krishna Kumar vs. Yogesh Kumar & another, by the court of Chief Judicial Magistrate, Dehradun.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 349,
      "end": 562,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "14.09.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 413,
          "end": 423
        },
        {
          "text": "Complaint Case No. 4033 of 2021",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 435,
          "end": 466
        },
        {
          "text": "Krishna Kumar vs. Yogesh Kumar & another",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 468,
          "end": 508
        },
        {
          "text": "Chief Judicial Magistrate, Dehradun",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 526,
          "end": 561
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.35314661264419556
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "By which, the petitioner has been summoned under Sections 406 & 420 IPC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 563,
      "end": 635,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sections 406",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 612,
          "end": 624
        },
        {
          "text": "420",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 627,
          "end": 630
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 631,
          "end": 634
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2908632159233093
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "Heard learned counsel for the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 637,
      "end": 675,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner appeared through video conferencing.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 676,
      "end": 747,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "It is argued that the petitioner is a Bank Manager.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 748,
      "end": 800,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27861690521240234
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "He has not committed any offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 801,
      "end": 834,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3540581464767456
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The matter was once inquired by C.O., he did not find that the petitioner committed any offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 835,
      "end": 931,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28228163719177246
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Reference has been made to annexure-5, the inquiry report, submitted by C.O., Vikas Nagar, District Dehradun in the matter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 932,
      "end": 1055,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vikas Nagar",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1010,
          "end": 1021
        },
        {
          "text": "Dehradun",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1032,
          "end": 1040
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1585139036178589
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "According to the complaint filed by respondent no. 1, the petitioner in his capacity as a Branch Manager, Punjab National Bank, Dakpathar, District Dehradun has simply deducted money from the account of respondent no. 1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1056,
      "end": 1277,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Punjab National Bank",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1163,
          "end": 1183
        },
        {
          "text": "Dakpathar",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1185,
          "end": 1194
        },
        {
          "text": "Dehradun",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1205,
          "end": 1213
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22349564731121063
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "In fact, it is a case that the respondent no. 2 had submitted one cheque in District Bijnore, which was sent for encashment at Vikasnagar Branch.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1278,
      "end": 1423,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bijnore",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1363,
          "end": 1370
        },
        {
          "text": "Vikasnagar",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1405,
          "end": 1415
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2657593786716461
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "From Vikasnagar Branch, it was sent to the concerned Branch of Nainital Bank.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1424,
      "end": 1501,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vikasnagar",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1429,
          "end": 1439
        },
        {
          "text": "Nainital Bank",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1487,
          "end": 1500
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30965855717658997
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "It was dishonoured, but the information could not be sent to District Bijnore.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1502,
      "end": 1580,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bijnore",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1572,
          "end": 1579
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4046182930469513
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Due to this reason, the respondent no. 2, withdrew the huge amount and some of the amount was transferred by him in the account of respondent no. 1,\nwho happens to be his brother-in-law.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1581,
      "end": 1767,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.387342631816864
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Subsequently, it is the case of respondent no. 1 that he was forced to make the payment.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1768,
      "end": 1857,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3461797833442688
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Having considered, this Court is of the view that this matter definitely requires deliberation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1858,
      "end": 1954,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20073123276233673
    },
